    {
      "id": "claim_6a4b0c42e3554e9bbe79c3e48849dc45",
      "statement": "The BFF's HTTP surface is implemented as Expo Router +api.ts route handlers under frontend/mcm-app/src/app/bff-api/ (auth, collections/movies proxy, agent, backups, admin/settings), while its business logic lives in frontend/mcm-app/src/bff-server/; in production/Docker this is served by frontend/mcm-app/server.js, an Express adapter wrapping @expo/server.",
