      "id": "claim_e91a51ae25a546a1b3e1caee71f4aa7f",
      "statement": "Every mc-service proxy route in the BFF follows the same pipeline: requireAuth() then a requireMcUser()/requireMcAdmin() RBAC check, then a per-request mc-service-client.ts Axios instance carrying the caller's own JWT as Authorization: Bearer, with handleMcApiError() translating mc-service's RFC 9457 problem+json responses on failure.",
      "evidence": [
